1
00:00:00,101 --> 00:00:02,051
(Penny:)It's no problem.
Is everything okay?

2
00:00:02,203 --> 00:00:06,013
(Sheldon:)I'm fine. It's just some
stomach medication for my trip.

3
00:00:06,174 --> 00:00:08,884
(Sheldon:)There's the remote
yet distinct possibility

4
00:00:09,044 --> 00:00:11,354
(Sheldon:)that I may end up
in South America.

5
00:00:13,882 --> 00:00:15,882
(Penny:)Remember the old days when I
would've said something dumb

6
00:00:16,051 --> 00:00:17,861
like, "Why?"

7
00:00:22,757 --> 00:00:24,297
(Penny:)Uh, that doesn't sound good.

8
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:27,300
(Penny:)Remember the old days
when I used to point out

9
00:00:27,462 --> 00:00:29,132
(Sheldon:)that your check engine light
was on?

10
00:00:30,932 --> 00:00:33,242
(Sheldon:)-Yes.
-Get ready to go down memory lane.

11
00:00:33,401 --> 00:00:36,541
(Sheldon:)-Penny, your check engine...
-Yeah, I know it's on, Sheldon!

12
00:00:36,704 --> 00:00:39,984
(Penny:)Oh, no, no.
I cannot afford this right now.

13
00:00:40,642 --> 00:00:42,422
(Sheldon:)Maybe it's just something minor.

14
00:00:51,152 --> 00:00:52,792
(Sheldon:)Oh, good news,
the light just went out.

15
00:00:59,661 --> 00:01:01,141
(Leonard:)Are we playing individual
or teams?

